Drosophila
heads were fixed in fix solution [4% paraformaldehyde, 3.5% glutaraldehyde, 2 mM CaCl
2
, 100 mM cacodylate buffer (pH 7.40)] with rocking overnight at 4°C. Heads were washed three times in 100 mM cacodylate buffer and post-fixed in 2% osmium tetroxide buffered with 100 mM cacodylate buffer for 1 h at room temperature. The heads were washed twice with 100 mM cacodylate buffer and once with dH
